  "id": "camouflage",
  "term": "camouflage",
  "definition": "Camouflage is coloration or patterning that helps an animal blend with its surroundings so it is harder for observers to detect. Its effectiveness depends on how light interacts with the environment and on features such as shadows, habitat structure, and the visual limits of the animals viewing it.",
